* '.' in a vsect is the offset counter (the org of the structure above), not the data location
* (both r68 manuals): Size equ .-First is that counter (10) less First's offset (2) in First's
* section, a global symbol B Size 8, as r68 writes it (the link adds the data's base).
* fixed: 0c24e8b 2026-10-12 r68togas, m68k-os9-r68: .-LABEL with LABEL a vsect label, as r68 makes it
* expect sym: B Size 00000008
* expect text: 47ea0000
* expect reloc: R_68K_16          First
 org 0
Rec_A do.l 1
Rec_B do.w 3
 psect dot_less_vsect,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
Pad ds.w 1
First: ds.l 1
Second ds.w 1
Size: equ .-First
 ends
 lea First(a2),a3
 ends
